{
  "slug": "dev-environment-doctor",
  "name": "Dev Environment Doctor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Detect and fix local environment issues before they break your workflow.\n\nDev Environment Doctor runs safe, read-only checks for environment variables, services, and tool versions, and provides clear, actionable fixes to keep your development setup healthy.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (5): `check_env` (Validate required environment variables from common project files), `check_services` (Check whether local dev services are reachable (DB, cache, queue)), `check_versions` (Validate tool versions against project requirements), `doctor` (Run a full dev environment health check and return a single report), `suggest_fixes` (Generate a prioritized fix plan based on environment checks)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dev-environment-doctor@claude-community` from `DhruvTilva/dev-env-doctor`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
